1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:04,568
Yesterday, pigeons. Today, obedience.

2
00:00:04,608 --> 00:00:07,269
The pigeons are still here.

3
00:00:07,309 --> 00:00:13,625
The Obedience Ray. One shot, and
everyone does exactly what I say.

4
00:00:13,665 --> 00:00:17,121
Three, two, one!

5
00:00:17,841 --> 00:00:21,845
People of Earth! Kneel before me!

6
00:00:22,315 --> 00:00:25,657
Oh, terribly sorry. After you.

7
00:00:25,697 --> 00:00:29,453
No, no, I insist. After you.

8
00:00:29,493 --> 00:00:31,747
I said kneel!

9
00:00:32,217 --> 00:00:36,158
Of course! Can I get you anything?
A cup of tea?

10
00:00:36,198 --> 00:00:38,339
He's very obedient.

11
00:00:38,379 --> 00:00:41,040
Stop being nice to me!

12
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:44,118
You're doing a wonderful job, love.

13
00:00:45,488 --> 00:00:49,422
About the rent, dear.
No rush at all.

14
00:00:49,462 --> 00:00:50,985
Leave it on.
